  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/616",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf9b7ba533a5c1d6174c9cf027ded46de5ff7dbe\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf9b7ba533a5c1d6174c9cf027ded46de5ff7dbe\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5321b49eed2f39249ee9e4a40f3bed4df2a3fcb3\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5321b49eed2f39249ee9e4a40f3bed4df2a3fcb3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">게임에</span>..... 약간 지나치게 -_-;;; 필 받아</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c69a8742f110beb7df5539211b9d62b38c0e1b71\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c69a8742f110beb7df5539211b9d62b38c0e1b71\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>인생 뭐 있겠습니까....</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">무념무상의 칼질</span>을 시작해봅니다.</b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">8조</span> 까짓...썰어보지요. 하하하;;;;</b><br>&#160;<br><b>게임 시작 전에 A4 출력물을 조원과 함께 보며 </b><br><b>[시베리아기단] 관련 내용 찾기!</b><br><b>를 먼저하면 좋습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;같은 기단끼리 카드 짝지어 모아 &#9733;점수를 쌓는 게임입니다.&gt;</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7035cb45d259639c5ec3f0253025d7038d5a4cc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7035cb45d259639c5ec3f0253025d7038d5a4cc\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>시작은 <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><u>더미(쌓아올린)와 1장을 까고,</u>&#160;</span></b><br><b>사진처럼 시작합니다.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8993086628f53a677f0ac217c3498a6c00b29e50\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8993086628f53a677f0ac217c3498a6c00b29e50\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>4인 1조로 </b><br><b>자기차례에 <span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">더미의 카드를 깝니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>옷! 처음부터<span style=\"color: #ef6f53;\"> 짝궁</span>이 딱 맞군요!!!</b><br><b>시베리아 짝궁입니다!</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/977abc7ab8ca29a9f522fee0ba5d36b38ad84769\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/977abc7ab8ca29a9f522fee0ba5d36b38ad84769\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>그럼, <span style=\"color: #0593d3;\">별2개 별3개를</span> <br>살포시 자기 앞으로 가져옵니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>총 별 5개 획득!</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #1b711d;\">누가누가 별을 많이 모으나<br></span>로 위너를 정하는 </b><b>간단한 게임입니다.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7557f19b82ae606ed4c436f2ceaae17e3a508094\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7557f19b82ae606ed4c436f2ceaae17e3a508094\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>이번엔 <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">깔린</span> 아이들이 많네요.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a05c228a65ace32c7d1f9e2e7387b5272a02703\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a05c228a65ace32c7d1f9e2e7387b5272a02703\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>대륙! 이 나왔습니다.&#160;</b><br><b>그럼, <span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">대륙은 짝은 누구?</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3763f292c60481fab0f6473ca34b2241f91fa35\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3763f292c60481fab0f6473ca34b2241f91fa35\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>그렇죠~! 시베리아 기단이죠!</b><br><b>앗싸! <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">[기단]은 별이 가장 많은</span> 4개랍니다.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eb122caaa414f133b1d7f407c597fd6a5ea82b8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eb122caaa414f133b1d7f407c597fd6a5ea82b8\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>이번에도 깔린게 많군요!</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4dca402999aefc3ce756fac3289898ba7affff6a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4dca402999aefc3ce756fac3289898ba7affff6a\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">조커</span>의 등장!</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">기단 카드는 <u><span style=\"color: #ef5369;\">아무거나 짝지어 </span></u></span>가져갈 수 있습니다.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/085435aeb23f139bfb7938a48d1ef13343f983c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/085435aeb23f139bfb7938a48d1ef13343f983c2\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>깔린 것중에<span data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 온난건조가 별4개!</span>로 제일 많으니</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bbeb9a4ac12e4fda3f437a0b2bf62aae1fd8329\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bbeb9a4ac12e4fda3f437a0b2bf62aae1fd8329\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>그럼 당연! 온난건조로 접수!</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db6f82db09d0cc5e560df17cbecd66e00f0c610a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db6f82db09d0cc5e560df17cbecd66e00f0c610a\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">총 30장의 카드</span>는&#160;</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">(4기단 x 7장) + 조커 2개 = 30장</span></b><br><b>으로 이루어져 있습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>게임 말미에</b><br>&#160;<br><b>흩어진 카드 중<span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"> &quot;OO기단 모두 모아라!&quot;</span> 하고 <u><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">스피드 게임</span></u>을 합니다.</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aea19888cee6f5dae30cce66e8e020820bc801da\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aea19888cee6f5dae30cce66e8e020820bc801da\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>총<span data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 8장씩</span>&#160;모을 수 있습니다.&#160;</b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2241097343ec42c7d980977822462be2088f9e8d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2241097343ec42c7d980977822462be2088f9e8d\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f846b69a0b7242b254835f641f795055e9e9d5cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f846b69a0b7242b254835f641f795055e9e9d5cb\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d4252da630b5790660697e039bfc954a9dae2d3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d4252da630b5790660697e039bfc954a9dae2d3\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">지도 이미지는 비상자료입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">고스톱게임이라 한건</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">애들이 룰을 알려주니 바로</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&quot;이거 고스톱이네요~!&quot; 하더라구요. ^^;;&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>아이들이 air mass 와 놀 수 있는 그날까지!&#160;<br>&#160;<br>칼질 동지 선생님들<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">재과만은 사랑입니다.&#160;</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a08101e0fa44fb6c044a940a8b971200f14e04a4?download\" data-file-name=\"기단게임.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1556480\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D616%26fileid%3D19%26regdt%3D20220512130840&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa08101e0fa44fb6c044a940a8b971200f14e04a4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기단게임</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.48MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
